    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_105_emper",
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "Well if it ain't a Siracusan stray right here in my lounge. You're all outta crossbow bolts? And I'm still standin'?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "So this is the Emperor. You come through a rain of arrows still holding your drink. Lucky bastard."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_101_sora_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sora",
        "text": "...Lungmen isn't much for straight up, close-quarters fighting."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#7"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "If you don't play by the rules, you get kicked out of the game."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Rules?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
            "volume": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 3
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "By the time the cops get here, all they're gonna find are your splattered corpses, Penguin Logistics."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bison",
        "text": "...it's all their people out there."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
            "name2": "char_201_moeshd#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "They got the back covered too. Looks like this feller's mighty thorough."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "That coward Capone is too afraid of the Rat King and Wei Yenwu, even if that one might need a thought or two..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "But you and the Rat King? You ain't worth a second look."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "name2": "char_105_emper",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "Yeah? Is that really what you think? Or you just tryin' to sound scary?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
            "name2": "char_105_emper",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "I believe it with all my heart, 'Mr. Emperor.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd#3",
            "name2": "char_105_emper",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "Croissant, grab me a bottle. Our friend here's got the broke brain. I'm gonna do him a favor and fix it up for him."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd#4",
            "name2": "char_105_emper",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "But baws, not for nothin', we already smashed a couple million Lungmen dollars' worth of booze over here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd#4",
            "name2": "char_105_emper",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "...and how much were their lives worth?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd#4",
            "name2": "char_105_emper",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "Don't see how it could add up to that much."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd#4",
            "name2": "char_105_emper",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "Are we doing this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_105_emper"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "Nah. We're keeping the deal we made with Lil Wei. We don't go all out in Lungmen, we don't make trouble, we don't threaten life and limb. Keep it professional. Business is business."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "But we been on the run for a grand total of five hours today. That's double my normal work day. Double!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "Not to mention we torched a whole year's worth of goodies! Cars, booze, and my precious vinyl!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "And now we got some tragic, unanticipated deaths here in my club. What're we gonna do about all this? Hm?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Texas. This name of yours displeases me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "I don't recall knowing any Siracusans like you. But you're about to go running out of Lungmen with your tail between your legs."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "You're gonna regret slandering my family, Texas."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Who here's the stray dog who ran off to Lungmen? You know the truth. You ain't fit to go toe to toe with a Sicilian."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "That's a good face right, there, Texas! You almost look Siracusan like that!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 3
        }
