            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_213_mostma_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "Wow."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "This is a surprise. You got called out too?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "You could say that. But it's honestly a relief to get pulled away from those cocktail parties."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "Hm. Does a small-time mafia dust-up really deserve such a grand response?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "No, it doesn't. But it makes for a nice excuse to tear myself away from troublesome social interactions."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Croissant has ordered a new custom accessory for her hammer. Exusiai has sought my help in caring for her beloved gun. In short, there is much to be done."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "Yeah, I might have something for you too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "No matter. Assisting my colleagues with such trivialities is one of my duties, in addition to my primary function."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "Can you look after this staff for me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "This white one. You do understand its significance, don't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "Just for tonight. Let me relax a bit and enjoy the Carnival."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "I can't exactly take it out onto the dance floor with me. I'll lose control."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Of course. I will take it. It's my responsibility."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "Heh. It always comes down to work, huh? Thanks anyway."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "You want to go for a drink afterwards? It's on me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "I would love to. Socializing over drinks with colleagues is vastly more meaningful than the empty social niceties I've endured."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "But I'm afraid, looking at these movements, it may be a challenge to save The Ends of the Earth."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "...So, did you just get in to Lungmen? How much do you know about what's gone on tonight?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Everything. The threads that make up this year's Carnival are uncomplicated. The tapestry is abundantly clear to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "Are you not going to help?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "I am not. I will leave the physical labor to your youthful vigor, look after your items, enjoy a cup of tea, and wait for the situation to resolve itself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Right then. The Rat King is waiting for you. Do please enjoy yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035",
            "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "You too, Yith."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "It's Sauin. It only comes once a year. Don't work yourself too hard."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "Anyway, I'm out."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yith",
        "text": "...Sauin?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yith",
        "text": "Oh my. I was supposed to take off for Sauin."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yith",
        "text": "And here I am working overtime like always... what a dreadful waste."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yith",
        "text": "But at least, now that she's entrusted you to me, we can reminisce about the good old days, my old friend."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yith",
        "text": "Mm. It's nice to grip you in my hand like this. No complaining."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
