        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "...we let them get away again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1#4",
            "name2": "char_103_angel_1#7",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "Should we go after them?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1",
            "name2": "char_103_angel_1#7",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "No. I may have underestimated them a bit."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "Even if they're a bunch of losers who ran off to Lungmen, they're still Sicilian mobsters."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1",
            "name2": "char_101_sora_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sora",
        "text": "Texas, are you hurt?! L- let me take care of you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1",
            "name2": "char_101_sora_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "It's not deep, don't worry."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1",
            "name2": "char_101_sora_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sora",
        "text": "I'm worrying! Sit down. I'll get the first aid kit..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bison",
        "text": "Sicilians... what's a Sicilian anyway? Is it a kind of Siracusan?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "The Sicilian Union is one of the origins of Siracusa's Twelve Families. It was the first city to turn to violence to achieve its goals."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "It's where we get the word 'Sicilian' in Siracusan."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "But these days... the word has kind of a different meaning... it's pretty rare for a Siracusan to actually call herself a 'Sicilian.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "They're not as strong as they used to be... for a whole bunch of reasons. But if they still call themselves that... well..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1#4",
            "name2": "char_103_angel_1#7",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "Breathe, Texas, breathe. You're wearing yourself out talking that much."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "The main point is it's a way for wannabe dangerous mobsters to tell everybody they think they're dangerous mobsters, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1#4",
            "name2": "char_103_angel_1#7",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "...yeah."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bison",
        "text": "We can't let them keep ambushing us like this. Our losses are only going to get worse."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bison",
        "text": "We have to hit back, we need a..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_105_emper"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "Hold up. Just everybody hold the eff up. What excuse do you think I can give to my dumbass alcohol allergic bartender friend to explain what happened to his place?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd#3",
            "name2": "char_105_emper",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "Um... is there an explanation...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd",
            "name2": "char_105_emper",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "At least the stool yer sittin' on's in great shape there, boss."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd",
            "name2": "char_105_emper",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "All we got left's one barstool?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_101_sora_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sora",
        "text": "Yes... that one barstool."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_105_emper"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "...Aight. Broken bottles, shot up walls, and tattered velvet got its own unique vibe to it. Yeah. This is my new renovation, redecoratin' the joint!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "Noooo way. Nobody's going to buy that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "We prob'ly just gotta pay him back for all the damages, huh? Aaagh. Looks like we're gonna hafta tighten our belts at Penguin Logistics fer a while."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "Plus the whole place stinks of alcohol. And I'm all sticky. At least it's disinfecting my wounds."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1",
            "name2": "char_101_sora_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sora",
        "text": "Don't be stupid, you can't use wine as a disinfectant! Here, I've got some medical alcohol... why is there a straw? N- never mind. Here, Texas, let me apply it..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_105_emper"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "...I had another idea."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "If these punks gotta come at us on Sauin..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
